x bug (TypeError, fixed) with the four sanity-target validations before the negative result was trusted; the prior-session alarms (the subT N−j slip, the DeVos Z₄×Z₂ column-major vs the recursion's row-major, the timeout splits) also on record. Rebuild rule executed: the appendix gained the "Adversarial review (session 67)" record + an editions-paragraph sentence + the footer's "+ adversarial review (session 67)" extension; hygiene green post-edit (fences 12 balanced, mojibake 0, no session references before the appendix); the web edition rebuilt with fidelity proof first (the old payload, 142,643 B, decode-equal to the pre-edit master; the old-payload re-render byte-exact against the old .html by a verbatim port of the frame's own renderMd, the export's own head/tail and its newline-wrapping convention kept verbatim); codec round-trip green; payload 136,715 chars / 142,643 bytes → 144,036 chars / 150,194 bytes (b64 190,192 → 200,260, mod 4 = 0, line 49), frame untouched, web canvas + web master both 206,611 chars / 206,617 bytes at the 138-line convention (canvas == master, diff -q ✓; the independent shell extract-diff md5 equal both sides); .html rebaked 154,652 → 162,305 B, no script, no MD_B64, the write-back gate green (the .html == head + renderMd(new payload) + tail exactly). Chapter master == canvas + the trailing newline: 1,236 lines / 144,195 chars / 150,355 bytes. One honest cross-chapter note: the merge-monitor repair (16,988 → 9,759) leaves Ch. 7's master still carrying the stale 16,988 at its line 673 — no Ch. 7 edit per the one-unit rule; the discrepancy is recorded in atlas row 67 for the arc's future reference. Chapter-map row 9's history extended (backfill session 41 + review session 67) + stats refreshed (1,236 lines / 144,195 chars / 150,355 bytes). Masters synced: cgt-ch9-sumsets-shadows.md, cgt-ch9-web.md, cgt-ch9-web.html, cgt-atlas.md. Arc tracker: Ch. 9 ✅ (session 67), Ch. 10 next. Full record: atlas session-log row 67.**
